From: Project Management <project@bluewater-energy.example> (Bluewater Energy Services)
To: Project Management <project@mercon-steel.example> (Mercon Steel Structures)
Date: 2009-02-03
Subject: Notice of Termination under Clause 30

MERCON has not immediately commenced and continuously proceeded with action satisfactory to BLUEWATER to remedy the defaults identified in our Notice of Default of 23 January 2009. BLUEWATER hereby issues a Notice of Termination of the Contract under Clause 30.

